---
import HubPage from '../components/HubPage.astro';
---

<HubPage
  path="/all-services/"
  hub="services"
  crumbLabel="Services"
  eyebrow="Services"
  heading="Clothing manufacturing services under one roof"
  lead="Our clothing manufacturing services cover every step from your idea to a packed carton. That means samples, patterns, cutting, sewing, printing, embroidery, finishing and checks. One team does it all in our own factory."
  groups={[{ heading: 'Services', kinds: ['service'] }]}
>
  <h2>How the services fit together</h2>
  <p>
    Most brands use the services in order. First comes a <a href="/sample-service/">proto and pre-production sample</a>. Then we move to
    <a href="/cut-and-sew-service/">cut-and-sew production</a>, with printing and a final check done in-house. Our
    <a href="/work-process/">production process page</a> shows the time and payment for each step.
  </p>
</HubPage>
